        "posted_on": "2025-09-26",
        "last_update": "2025-09-26",
        "abstract": "TypeScript’s type system can do much more than catch mistakes. It can guide users toward valid code. In this post, I illustrate some of TypeScript's power by building a tiny Directed Acyclic Graph (\"DAG\") library that is type-safe by construction.\n",
