        "title": "Elixir, a good fit for financial risk management applications?",
        "posted_on": "2025-06-19",
        "last_update": "2025-06-19",
        "abstract": "Elixir is a great language for building servers and web applications. But can it be used effectively for building applications that require the use of a scientific stack? Those would usually be built using Python, given the large ecosystem that language has to offer.\nSince falling in love with Elixir, I've wondered if Python could be ditched for the specific use case of building finance/risk-management-related applications.\nCan it? Let's explore!\n",
